 "what_the_measurement_settles": [
  "The city things-to-do family is not merely present in Turkish, it is the deepest version of that family measured anywhere in this project. Seventeen cities carry volume and twelve of them clear 7,000 a month: Istanbul 33,000, Bursa 31,000, Eskisehir 27,000, Antalya 26,000, Mardin 21,000, Trabzon 17,000, Gaziantep 17,000, Izmir 16,000, Konya 13,000, Rize 12,000, Safranbolu 9,300, Alanya 8,200. Keyword difficulty is 0, 1 or 2 on every one of them. Compare de-DE, where the same family tops out well below this and the tail falls away faster.",
  "The depth reaches far below the big cities, which is what decides whether a tier cap can be lifted here. Datca has roughly 12,000 inhabitants and 5,700 searches a month. Kas has roughly 8,000 and 4,100. Safranbolu has roughly 50,000 and 9,300. Population is not demand in Turkish either, and the harvest-style entity override is the mechanism that reaches these towns.",
  "Named outdoor entities are the second pillar and they measure larger in Turkish than the German equivalents that first justified the family: Nemrut Dagi 47,000, Agri Dagi 29,000, Erciyes Dagi 11,000, Kackar Daglari 6,300, Alanya Kalesi 6,100, Bodrum Kalesi 5,500.",
  "The neighbourhood list works in Turkish for cafes and breakfast, not for restaurants. Kadikoy kahvalti mekanlari 2,300, Kadikoy kafeler 1,500, Nisantasi kafeler 1,100, Karakoy 600, Cihangir 500, against Besiktas restoranlari at 20. The area family is admitted for the classes that measured and the restaurant class is held to the city level, where Ankara italyan restorani reads 900 and Izmir balik restoranlari 700.",
  "The ticket and opening-hours intent on a named entity is real: Topkapi 7,300, Sumela 2,400, Pamukkale 1,400, Gobeklitepe 800.",
  "Four families measured at or near zero in Turkish and are REFUSED for this market rather than carried over from markets where they measured: neighbourhoods.city-where-to-stay (istanbul nerede kalinir 20, antalya nerede kalinir 50), weather.city-month (istanbul nisan ayi hava durumu 70, kapadokya kasim 20), weather.city-best-time (kapadokya ne zaman gidilir 200 and bodrum ne zaman gidilir 0, which is one weak keyword and one dead one, not a family), and rents.city (istanbul kiralik daire fiyatlari 40). These are the refusals that keep the market honest: admitting tr-TR is not admitting every family in it.",
  "stay.city-type carries the largest single number in the whole Turkish set, kapadokya otelleri at 57,000, and the highest difficulty, 52. That is an OTA keyword, and the measurement is recorded without being treated as an opening.",
  "The destination axis is strong in Turkish and points mostly at countries already captured: Tiflis 9,700, Viyana 4,100, Budapeste 3,600, Prag 3,600, Amsterdam 3,300, Atina 3,000, Saraybosna 2,900, Paris 2,600, Barselona 2,400, Berlin 2,200, Roma 2,200, Londra 2,100. Six of those twelve sit in countries whose OSM layers are on disk today."
 ],
