   "reading": "This one does NOT match the global class. outdoor_feature carries OPEN_SPECIALIST_PAGE_WINS at 85 on the German reading, where a DR 1 hobby photography blog held position 6. In Turkish the named-entity SERP is state-owned: local pack at 1, tr.wikipedia at 3, Tripadvisor at 4, then adiyaman.ktb.gov.tr DR 82, kulturportali.gov.tr DR 74 and muze.gov.tr DR 75 at 5, 6 and 7. Three government portals in the top seven. The Turkish outdoor-entity SERP is recorded as OFFICIAL_PLUS_AGGREGATOR_MIXED, 50 rather than 85, and this is a reason to publish these pages later than their volume suggests, not a reason to refuse them."
